        <p>The first of the eries of the half-hour lecture 4. insti- tuted by the Free Library Comm.ttee, was given in the lecture tholtre of the Tfichnical Institute, Widnqs on Friday evninoc,, last, by Mr. C. Lewis, B.A.,upon "Liter- ary Style." A rather poor Luli6nce was presided over by Councillor Flynn, VII RUMP, tu4P.3.—To comply with the new</p>
        <p>Borough Bye-Laws. Lowest prices.—J. S. G1111,4N1), IroillUouger, Bridge-street, Warrington.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-01-20_WidnesExaminer_art0061" n="art0061">
        <head>WARRII GTON. PERSONAL.</head>
