        <p>1. F one firm of manufacturers more than another keeps abreast of the times in the matter of implements for Sport, that firm is Gm. G. °INSET &amp; Co., who are leading the way again with their latest Improved" DSMOJI Dt ivor. Hockey Club, bearing their well known tr vle uerk .E-61342 Ask the local Sports Dealer for G. G. B. &amp; Co's Specs&amp; Hockey List. If not procurable apply to 35 &amp; 38. Queen Victoria-street. London. Factories—Packhaan, London ; and Elmswell, Sufblk. Advt. (2).</p>
